Was playing a wizard (decided to take a break of barbarians. They became boring) 
when I missed one of the features that make spellcasters easy in ADOM:

When you're low on power points, you can cast spells using your hit points (HP) 
as if they were power points. 

This may seem "too good to be true" but there is a bad side effect - it abuses 
your stats. So the game balance is kept.

Q: What do you think about implementing this in NetHack? I think it would not be 
too difficult to implement. Or is this too abusive?

